#~ msgid ""
#~ "Many of Urza Afalas’s troops are exhausted from battle and cannot attack this turn, but are still able to withdraw and reposition themselves.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Units that can move but can’t attack are shown with the <i>disengaged</i> orb."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Urza Afalas'ın birliklerinin çoğu savaştan yorgun düştü ve bu tur saldıramaz, ancak yine de geri çekilip kendilerini yeniden konumlandırabilirler.\n"
#~ "\n"
